food_prompt:
Identify all food in this image. Return only valid JSON — no extra text:
{"dishes":[{"name":string,"cuisine":string,"recipe_name":string,"ingredients":[{"name":string,"amount_g":number}]}]}
recipe_name: a concise human-friendly name for the dish as a recipe (e.g. "Chicken Stir Fry with Vegetables"). Estimate amount_g using surrounding objects (plates, cutlery, cups, hands) as size references; fall back to a typical restaurant serving size if no reference objects are visible. Be specific with ingredient names (e.g. "basmati rice" not "rice").

discovery_prompt:
List the food dishes visible in this image. Return only valid JSON — no extra text:
{"dishes":["dish name 1","dish name 2"]}
Be specific (e.g. "pad thai" not "noodles").

dish_detail_prompt:
For the dish "{{dish_name}}" visible in this image, list its ingredients with estimated gram weights. Return only valid JSON — no extra text:
{"name":"{{dish_name}}","cuisine":"string","recipe_name":"string","ingredients":[{"name":"string","amount_g":number}]}
Estimate amount_g using surrounding objects as size references; fall back to a typical restaurant serving. Be specific with ingredient names (e.g. "basmati rice" not "rice").
